@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Optional race: expired claim and stale completion
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

participant "Worker A" as A
database "Local claim / result" as D
participant "Worker B" as B
participant "Remote facility" as R
A -> D : claim generation g1
A -> R : dispatch attempt17
B -> D : acquire eligible newer generation g2
A -> D : late local result with g1
D --> A : reject stale local write if fencing enforced
B -> R : reconcile same attempt17 only if supported
note over A,R
 g2 does not stop A's already dispatched remote effect.
 Lease expiry does not authorize B to resend / relaunch.
 Cancellation request is not confirmed remote stop.
end note

@enduml
